<TD WIDTH="1%" VALIGN="top">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt"><U>Interest and finance costs</U> for the six months ended June&nbsp;30, 2024 were $1.7&nbsp;million and related
to the accrued interest expense &#150; related party, as of June&nbsp;30, 2024 in connection with the $53.3&nbsp;million, part of the acquisition prices of our Aframax tanker Afrapearl II &#150; which was subsequently completely paid off in July
2024 &#150; and our bulk carrier Eco Spitfire, which is payable by April 2025. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
